  "title": "Portolan CH — Cloud-Native Swiss Geodata",
  "description": "A proof-of-concept federated STAC catalog for Swiss federal and cantonal geodata. Inspired by the Portolan NL demo, this catalog federates data from federal agencies (swisstopo, BAFU) and Swiss cantons (Bern, Luzern, Basel-Stadt) using STAC, GeoParquet, and object storage — open, standards-based, and freely accessible.",
